    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 'To Grant A Wish' you play as a Minor Deity, whose presence has been fading due to a lack of worship. One day, you receive an offering on your shrine that grants you more power than you have had in a\u00a0<i>century</i>, and you set out, determined to grant their wish.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, this isn't quite so simple as it seems...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>The Player Character</strong></u>: Zephyr\u00a0<i>(Name Changeable)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769530/extras/fe945f9e46bcccb3272a649670a22fbe.avif?t=1750320013\" data-has-big width=800 height=686 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Minor Deity of the Breeze. The player character is kind and playful, if a bit out of touch with society.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>There are three versions, each with three different skin tone options, for a total of 9 possible MC's.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>The Characters</strong></u>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Bells</u>:\u00a0<i>(They/Them)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bells VA:\u00a0Brandon P Jenkins and Kirsty Woolven</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769530/extras/2b3c2494d6d636ef4288960df9e3afb9.avif?t=1750320013\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769530/extras/b38cdb2f7cc14a5106f02297973ccbfa.avif?t=1750320013\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A cheerful and friendly traveller who makes their living as a dancer. They are almost never seen without their curious mouse companion Chimes. They seem perfectly happy, so what has lead to them making a wish at your shrine?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Chimes</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Chimes VA:\u00a0Noah Belachew\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769530/extras/678a3a5fd3d8b5512dbe61c4cfc225c5.avif?t=1750320013\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><i> </i><br><u>Leo/Sam</u>:\u00a0<i>(Leo:\u00a0He/Him and Sam: She/Her.)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Leo VA:\u00a0Nicholas Contreras + Sam VA: Whitney Holland</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769530/extras/947fb9690964d10b17e5f47a1689892c.avif?t=1750320013\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769530/extras/55bd04d2b73fe14fa70b5ad171d72481.avif?t=1750320013\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><i>A tired and over-worked older sibling who is trying their best for their little brother. What has got them so stressed? And perhaps more importantly, is there anything you can do to help? </i><br><i> </i><br><u>Oscar</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Oscar\u00a0VA:\u00a0Allison Man</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769530/extras/fbb19b57c62306c5abc4ab38185c8d6c.avif?t=1750320013\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The excitable younger brother of Leo/Sam. He is enraptured by pirates, especially the brave Captain Fin. What's got him so concerned about his older sibling that he makes a wish at your shrine?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i> <br><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Lorelei/Callen</u>:<i> (Lorelei: (She/Her) and Callen:\u00a0He/Him)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lorelei VA: EvelynnDE and Callen VA:\u00a0Marlon Dance-Hooi</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769530/extras/27946c142fcc274558fa6e1feeefd9f4.avif?t=1750320013\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769530/extras/d1498623748689ff1fcd17a538657bc8.avif?t=1750320013\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A responsible and hard-working young person who claims that they won't allow anyone to dictate their fate anymore. What were they praying for then, when they visited your shrine?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recommended Route Order:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no strict route order, however I\u00a0personally recommend Bells (Purple\u00a0Bracelet) -&gt; Lorelei/Callen (Fur Tuft Necklace)\u00a0\u00a0-&gt;\u00a0Leo/Sam (Shark Pirate Toy) as certain elements might be more meaningful if you have seen certain parts of the other routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selectable appearance and deity\u00a0pronouns for the player character (God/Goddess/Deity).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom name for the player character (voiced names below).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150k words for an estimated 12-15 hours of playtime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over ten pursuable characters (not including alternate versions such as Leo/Sam or Lorelei/Callen), with more to come.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 75+ CG's.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A range of adorable dog-themed logo screens, picked randomly when you launch the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voiced Names:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to the kind support of the Kickstarter backers, the following names are voiced in the game :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zephyr\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Aura\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Astra\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Vashka\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Janna\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Clementine\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Josh\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Jasmine (can also be spelt Jasmin)\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Elaine\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Magnus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mahina</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aelin (can also be spelled: Aylin, or Alin)\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furry</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some specific characters will also voice the following names:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Milo\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Xochi</p></li></ul>",
